From: MedyMa <75345465+MedyMa@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] hostapd: bound vendor neighbor reports and partial iface cleanup

Validate TLVs before reading or updating neighbor reports. Restrict the compact
MLO conversion to its supported layout and preserve other layouts unchanged.
Check candidate parser errors before converting int lengths to size_t, cap
frames to the management MPDU size, and guard optional BSS filename arrays.

--- a/src/ap/neighbor_db.c
+++ b/src/ap/neighbor_db.c
